{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And he said</b> — One of the Geonim said: Nebuchadnezzar knew the dream and came to test his wise men. Were it not so, he would not have believed Daniel's words. But Scripture testifies: \"My spirit was troubled to know the dream,\" and when he said to him, \"your thoughts upon your bed,\" he immediately remembered that it was so, and when he mentioned the statue, then he recalled it thus."], :book :daniel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Daniel - Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/daniel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:19:00.969968793Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}